{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/851353-postponing-nightmares","id":851353,"title":"Postponing Nightmares","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-22T14:16:37-07:00","id":851353,"title":"Postponing Nightmares","content":"The text of Beast makes an offhand mention that the Begotten can put the effects of a Nightmare on hold until the victim next sleeps. The book, however, does not offer any reasons for why a Beast may wish to do with. I suppose there's wanting to fuck with someone while maintaining a shroud of plausible deniability, but surely there must be more creative uses for this little quirk.<br /> <br /> So! Dear forumites, what are some good reasons for waiting until a chump is snoozing to unleash moral terror on their poor soul?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T14:32:06-07:00","id":851360,"title":"","content":"A Nemesis using Nightmares that reflect the wrongs of the victim to deny him respite from his punishment?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/me